8-char | Character operations. More character operations are provided in module Char.
9-unit | Unit operations
10-strconv | String conversion functions | Requires Option
11-pair | Pair operations
12-list | List operations. More list operations are provided in module List.
13-io | Input/output. Just declares stdin/out/err
14-stdout | Output functions on standard output
15-stderr | Output functions on standard error
16-stdin | Input functions on standard input | Requires option
17-out | General output functions | Requires list
18-in | General input functions
19-ref | References
